150+  00E7              ; Receive one ATM -> NeoGS ABI 1.0 frame through ZX DMA.
151+  00E7              ; Entry: resident dispatcher consumed E0h from ZXCMD; CBIT remains asserted.
152+  00E7              ; Resident code, stack and interrupt handlers must stay in WIN0-WIN2.
153+  00E7              ; OUT: carry clear/A=0, HL=#C000 and BC=derived frame size; otherwise
154+  00E7              ; carry set/A=status. Uses physical DMA page 42h (108000h), then maps it
155+  00E7              ; into WIN3. The callable dispatcher below routes E0h to this endpoint.
156+  00E7              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
157+  00E7              P126_NGS_DMA_MOD      EQU #1B
158+  00E7              P126_NGS_DMA_HAD      EQU #1C
