338+  020E              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
339+  020E              ; Resident command-dispatch entry, one bounded unit of work.
340+  020E              ; OUT: carry clear/Z=1/A=0 when no command is pending;
341+  020E              ;      carry clear/Z=0 with HL=#C000, BC=size on a valid E0h frame;
342+  020E              ;      carry set/A=status for a rejected command or receive failure.
343+  020E              ; The caller owns the resident main loop and must keep its stack/code outside
344+  020E              ; WIN3. E0h is consumed from ZXCMD while CBIT stays asserted until DMA is armed.
345+  020E              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
